## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Cost | Why |
|---|---|---|---|
| Frontend | **Vite + React** | Free | Modern, fast, component-based — scales to SaaS UI easily |
| Backend | **Express.js** | Free | Already in Node ecosystem, same language as automation |
| Database | **SQLite** (`better-sqlite3`) | Free | Zero-config, file-based. Swap to PostgreSQL later for cloud |
| Auth (our app) | **JWT tokens** + `bcrypt` | Free | Users sign up to OUR app with their own password |
| Auth (Naukri) | **Session capture** (browser cookies) | Free | User logs into Naukri once, we save cookies — no password stored |
| Scheduler | **node-cron** | Free | In-process cron, replaces GitHub Actions |
| AI Headlines | **Gemini API** (free tier) | Free | 15 RPM free tier is enough for daily updates |
| File Storage | **Local disk** (`./uploads/`) | Free | Move to S3/Supabase Storage later |
| Automation | **Existing Playwright + Stealth** | Free | Battle-tested, no changes needed |

