## Frontend Pages

### 1. 🏠 Landing Page
- Hero section explaining the product: "Keep your Naukri profile fresh. Automatically."
- How it works (3 steps): Sign up → Connect Naukri → Upload Resume → Relax
- CTA: "Get Started Free"

### 2. 🔐 Signup / Login
- Standard email + password registration (for OUR app)
- JWT-based session management

### 3. 📊 User Dashboard
- **Profile Status Card**: Connected/Disconnected, last boost time, next scheduled boost
- **Quick Actions**: "Boost Now" button, "Update Resume", "Reconnect Naukri"
- **Stats**: Total boosts this month, success rate, streak count
- **Current Headline Preview**: Shows the last AI-generated headline

### 4. 📋 Activity Log
- Table/timeline of all automation runs
- Columns: Date, Headline Used, Resume Uploaded (Y/N), Status, Duration
- Filter by date range, status
- Click to expand: see full logs, error details, failure screenshots

### 5. ⚙️ Settings
- **Naukri Connection**: "Connect Naukri Account" button → opens a browser window for manual login → captures session
- **Resume Management**: Upload/replace resume, set job role and proof points
- **Schedule**: Toggle on/off, pick time slots
- **Account**: Change password, delete account (wipes all data)

