## Phased Rollout

### Phase 1 — Local MVP (What We Build Now)
- [x] Full backend API with SQLite
- [x] Frontend dashboard (React + Vite)
- [x] Session capture via local headed browser
- [x] Resume upload + storage
- [x] Manual "Boost Now" button
- [x] Scheduled automation via node-cron
- [x] Activity log with run history
- [x] AI headline generation (Gemini free tier)

### Phase 2 — Cloud Migration (Later)
- [ ] Deploy backend to Railway/Render
- [ ] Swap SQLite → PostgreSQL (Supabase free tier)
- [ ] Swap local disk → Supabase Storage for resumes
- [ ] Remote browser session for Naukri login (noVNC)
- [ ] Rotating proxies for multi-user IP isolation
- [ ] Email notifications (Resend free tier)
- [ ] Stripe integration for premium tier

